 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+* Footnotes are now numbered and ordered by the order in which they are first
+  referenced in the document rather than the order in which they are defined.
+  The new `USE_DEFINITION_ORDER` option of the footnotes extension restores the
+  previous behavior.
+
 ### Fixed
 
 * Fix handling of incomplete HTML tags in code spans in Python 3.14.
